{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L46","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/held-key-codes.ts:46"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Subscribes to the tracker store and updates the internal state when changes occur."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostConnected","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hostdisconnected","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hostDisconnected()"}]},{"type":"code","value":"hostDisconnected(): void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L62","children":[{"type":"text","value":"controllers/held-key-codes.ts:62"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Unsubscribes from the tracker store and stops tracking the held key codes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"implementation-of-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Implementation of"}]},{"type":"code","value":"ReactiveController.hostDisconnected","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"implements","text":"Implements","level":2},{"id":"constructors","text":"Constructors","level":2},{"id":"constructor","text":"Constructor","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"host","text":"_host","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"accessors","text":"Accessors","level":2},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3},{"id":"get-signature","text":"Get Signature","level":4},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":5},{"id":"methods","text":"Methods","level":2},{"id":"hostconnected","text":"hostConnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-3","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of","text":"Implementation of","level":4},{"id":"hostdisconnected","text":"hostDisconnected()","level":3},{"id":"returns-4","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"implementation-of-2","text":"Implementation of","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L27)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that tracks all currently held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\nSubscribes to the global KeyStateTracker and triggers host updates\nwhenever keys are pressed or released.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass KeyDisplay extends LitElement {\n  private heldKeyCodes = new HeldKeyCodesController(this)\n\n  render() {\n    const heldCodes = Object.entries(this.heldKeyCodes.value).map(([key, code]) => `${key}: ${code}`).join(' + ')\n    return html`\n      <div>\n        Currently pressed: ${heldCodes || 'None'}\n      </div>\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HeldKeyCodesController(_host): HeldKeyCodesController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L41)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HeldKeyCodesController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### value\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget value(): Record<string, string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L34)\n\nMap of currently held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`Record`\\<`string`, `string`\\>\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L46)\n\nSubscribes to the tracker store and updates the internal state when changes occur.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L62)\n\nUnsubscribes from the tracker store and stops tracking the held key codes.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: HeldKeyCodesController\ntitle: HeldKeyCodesController\n---\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L27)\n\nA Lit ReactiveController that tracks all currently held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\nSubscribes to the global KeyStateTracker and triggers host updates\nwhenever keys are pressed or released.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass KeyDisplay extends LitElement {\n  private heldKeyCodes = new HeldKeyCodesController(this)\n\n  render() {\n    const heldCodes = Object.entries(this.heldKeyCodes.value).map(([key, code]) => `${key}: ${code}`).join(' + ')\n    return html`\n      <div>\n        Currently pressed: ${heldCodes || 'None'}\n      </div>\n    `\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Implements\n\n- `ReactiveController`\n\n## Constructors\n\n### Constructor\n\n```ts\nnew HeldKeyCodesController(_host): HeldKeyCodesController;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L41)\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### \\_host\n\n`ReactiveControllerHost`\n\nThe Lit component that owns this controller.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`HeldKeyCodesController`\n\n## Accessors\n\n### value\n\n#### Get Signature\n\n```ts\nget value(): Record<string, string>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:34](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L34)\n\nMap of currently held key names to their physical `event.code` values.\n\n##### Returns\n\n`Record`\\<`string`, `string`\\>\n\n## Methods\n\n### hostConnected()\n\n```ts\nhostConnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:46](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L46)\n\nSubscribes to the tracker store and updates the internal state when changes occur.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostConnected\n```\n\n***\n\n### hostDisconnected()\n\n```ts\nhostDisconnected(): void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [controllers/held-key-codes.ts:62](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/controllers/held-key-codes.ts#L62)\n\nUnsubscribes from the tracker store and stops tracking the held key codes.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n#### Implementation of\n\n```ts\nReactiveController.hostDisconnected\n```\n"}
